OL,5,G1400 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FPhil meets a Shrewsbury family who
OL,7,     Fwant to put down roots in
OL,8,     FGloucestershire. And Kirstie gives
OL,9,     Fnewly-weds Fran and Tom a much
OL,10,     Fneeded helping hand in Bristol.
OL,11,G1500 Grand Designs
OL,12,     FPaul and Amy build a home made up
OL,13,     Fof five circular timber buildings
OL,14,     Flinked by raised walkways, beside
OL,15,     Fa Lincolnshire lake. But Paul's
OL,16,     Fhealth suffers as he struggles to
OL,17,     Ffinish it in a year.
